cks), and production-ready Docker Compose with Nginx and Let's Encrypt TLS.", "name": "visiban", "name_with_namespace": "Mike Bartosek / visiban", "path": "visiban", "path_with_namespace": "mikebartosek/visiban", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:04:36.287Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:mikebartosek/visiban.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/mikebartosek/visiban.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/mikebartosek/visiban", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/mikebartosek/visiban/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": null, "star_count": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-10-26T18:50:43.405Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 126531258, "name": "Mike Bartosek", "path": "mikebartosek", "kind": "user", "full_path": "mikebartosek", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/48d2f50e91dbb7f59332cad7ecf060e61cb8405da4efca8f06b9653dc9188f23?s=80&d=identicon", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/mikebartosek"}}, {"id": 87111058, "description": "OBLIQ.in is an audit and compliance workflow platform for small and mid-sized CA firms. It helps firms centralize client documents, assign and track audit tasks, manage reviews and corrections, monitor pending work, and maintain a clear audit trail of every important action.", "name": "OBLIQ-Website", "name_with_namespace": "OBLIQ-in / OBLIQ-Website", "path": "OBLIQ-Website", "path_with_namespace": "Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website", "created_at": "2026-10-01T08:26:34.801Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": null, "star_count": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-10-01T08:26:34.630Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id"